{"id":"n42162-5-9","stage":5,"title":"단단히 · 确确实实地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42162-5-9-1","ko":"내일이 시험인데도 하루 종일 야구 시합을 보고 말았어.","zh":"明天还有考试，我居然一整天都在看棒球比赛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일이","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험인데도","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야구","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시합을","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말았어.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"02f69fc1875bf310","term":"종일","zh":"整天，一天到晚","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3","entryId":"91758","definition":"从早晨到夜晚的时间段。","pronunciation":["종일"]},{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队员组成的两队轮流攻守，用棍子击打对方选手投出的球并绕竞技场一周即可得分的比赛。","pronunciation":["야ː구"]},{"id":"944bf12d99b921ad","term":"시합","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3","entryId":"13985","definition":"体育比赛等互相发挥实力决胜负。","pronunciation":["시합"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/95f3f863a52b54180486.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42162-5-9-2","ko":"네가 야구에 미쳐도 단단히 미쳤구나.","zh":"你要是真的对棒球这么着迷，那可真是迷得厉害啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야구에","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미쳐도","meaning":"迷恋，着迷，着魔","explanation":"미치다：迷恋，着迷，着魔；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"미치다","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62742","senseId":"4","lemma":"미치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단단히","meaning":"确确实实地","explanation":"단단히：确确实实地","readings":[{"term":"단단히","audio":"/audio/7d8581118bf8954a3c44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42162","senseId":"5","lemma":"단단히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미쳤구나.","meaning":"迷恋，着迷，着魔","explanation":"미치다：迷恋，着迷，着魔；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"미치다","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62742","senseId":"4","lemma":"미치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队员组成的两队轮流攻守，用棍子击打对方选手投出的球并绕竞技场一周即可得分的比赛。","pronunciation":["야ː구"]},{"id":"80cc63abcc13a410","term":"미치다","zh":"迷恋，着迷，着魔","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3","entryId":"62742","definition":"过分入迷。","pronunciation":["미치다"]},{"id":"7d8581118bf8954a","term":"단단히","zh":"确确实实地","audio":"/audio/7d8581118bf8954a3c44.mp3","entryId":"42162","definition":"程度超出一般地。","pronunciation":["단단히"]}],"audio":"/audio/5193dfd2b7e7c1dc6c77.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.496,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42162","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceS